{"id":1226,"date":"2025-05-13T14:28:11","date_gmt":"2025-05-13T12:28:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/rutas-de-senderismo-para-conectar-con-la-naturaleza-menorquina\/"},"modified":"2026-07-02T13:49:30","modified_gmt":"2026-07-02T11:49:30","slug":"rutas-de-senderismo-para-conectar-con-la-naturaleza-menorquina","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/rutas-de-senderismo-para-conectar-con-la-naturaleza-menorquina\/","title":{"rendered":"Rutes de Senderisme per Connectar amb la Naturalesa Menorquina"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1226\" class=\"elementor elementor-1226 elementor-181\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f6f8fe7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7f6f8fe7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b8ef8b8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4b8ef8b8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n<section class=\"vm-post vm-post--biosfera\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https:\/\/schema.org\/BlogPosting\">\n  <style>\n    .vm-post { --vm-max: 980px; --vm-gap: 1rem; --vm-radius: 16px; --vm-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08); --vm-primary:#1E73BE; --vm-whatsapp:#25D366; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color:#222; }\n    .vm-post a{ color:var(--vm-primary); text-decoration:none }\n    .vm-post .vm-hero{ position:relative; border-radius: var(--vm-radius); overflow:hidden; margin:0 0 1.25rem }\n    .vm-post .vm-hero img{ width:100%; height: clamp(260px, 42vw, 520px); object-fit: cover; display:block }\n    .vm-post .vm-hero::after{ content:\"\"; position:absolute; inset:0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,.70) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,.50) 45%, rgba(0,0,0,.40) 100%) }\n    .vm-post .vm-hero__content{ position:absolute; inset:0; display:flex; align-items:flex-end; padding: clamp(16px,3vw,32px); z-index:1; color:#fff }\n    .vm-post .vm-hero h1{ margin:0 0 .25rem; font-size: clamp(22px, 3.6vw, 34px); line-height:1.1; color:#fff; text-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.7)}\n    .vm-post .vm-hero p{ margin:.25rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(14px, 1.6vw, 18px); color:#fff; text-shadow:0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.7) }\n\n    .vm-post .vm-wrap{ max-width: var(--vm-max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(12px, 3vw, 20px) }\n\n    .vm-btns{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.75rem; margin: .75rem 0 1.25rem }\n    .vm-btn{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:.5rem; padding:.7rem 1rem; border-radius:999px; font-weight:600; box-shadow: var(--vm-shadow); color:#fff !important }\n    .vm-btn svg{ width:1.1em; height:1.1em }\n    .vm-btn--primary{ background: var(--vm-primary); color:#fff !important }\n    .vm-btn--whatsapp{ background: var(--vm-whatsapp); color:#fff !important }\n\n    .vm-card{ background:#fff; border-radius: var(--vm-radius); box-shadow: var(--vm-shadow); padding:1rem; }\n    .vm-toc{ margin:1.25rem 0 }\n    .vm-toc h2{ font-size:1rem; letter-spacing:.02em; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:.8; margin:.25rem 0 .5rem }\n    .vm-toc ul{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap:.25rem .75rem; list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0 }\n    .vm-toc a{ display:block; padding:.5rem .25rem }\n\n    .vm-badges{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.5rem; margin:.5rem 0 0 }\n    .vm-badge{ background:#f3f7fb; color:#0f2b46; padding:.35rem .6rem; border-radius:999px; font-size:.85rem }\n\n    .vm-grid{ display:grid; gap:1rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr; margin: 1.25rem 0 }\n    @media(min-width:820px){ .vm-grid{ grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr } }\n    figure{ margin:0 }\n    .vm-figure{ border-radius: var(--vm-radius); overflow:hidden }\n    .vm-figure img{ width:100%; height:100%; aspect-ratio: 3\/2; object-fit: cover; display:block }\n    figcaption{ font-size:.85rem; opacity:.8; margin-top:.35rem }\n\n    h2[id]{ scroll-margin-top: 90px }\n\n    .vm-info{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr)); gap:.5rem; margin:.75rem 0 }\n    .vm-info div{ background:#fafbfc; border:1px solid #eef1f5; padding:.6rem .7rem; border-radius:10px; font-size:.95rem }\n\n    .vm-note{ background:#fff8e6; border:1px solid #ffe3a3; padding: .8rem 1rem; border-radius: 12px; }\n\n    .vm-faq h3{ font-size:1rem }\n    .vm-cta-final{ text-align:center; padding:1.25rem 0 2rem }\n  \n    \/* T\u00edtulos m\u00e1s peque\u00f1os para secciones (sin afectar el TOC) *\/\n    .vm-post :not(.vm-toc) > h2{ font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 26px); line-height:1.25; margin:.2rem 0 .6rem }\n  <\/style>\n\n  \n  <div class=\"vm-hero\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Senderista frente al faro de Fav\u00e0ritx y el litoral volc\u00e1nico de Menorca\">\n    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Faro%20de%20Fav%C3%A0ritx.jpg?width=1600\" alt=\"Far de Fav\u00e0ritx a l'alba, costa nord de Menorca\">\n    <div class=\"vm-hero__content\">\n      <div class=\"vm-wrap\">\n        <h1 itemprop=\"headline\">Rutes de senderisme a Menorca: 6 itineraris per connectar amb la natura<\/h1>\n        <p>Cam\u00ed de Cavalls, barrancs, coves i el Parc Natural de s&#8217;Albufera des Grau: dist\u00e0ncies reals, temps, consells i normes per gaudir sense riscos.<\/p>\n        <div class=\"vm-btns\">\n          <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--whatsapp\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301?text=Hola%20Dani%2C%20quiero%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20rutas%20de%20senderismo%20en%20Menorca\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Escr\u00edbenos por WhatsApp\">WhatsApp Dani<\/a>\n          <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--primary\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/excursiones\/\" aria-label=\"Ver excursiones y rutas guiadas en Menorca\">Veure excursions<\/a>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <div class=\"vm-wrap\" itemprop=\"articleBody\">\n\n    \n    <div class=\"vm-card\">\n      <p>Menorca \u00e9s <strong>Reserva de la Biosfera<\/strong> des de 1993 i una aula a l&#8217;aire lliure per a qui camina: roques negres d&#8217;origen paleozoic al nord, gresos clars al sud, barrancs amb alzines i ullastres, i l&#8217;aiguamoll de <em>s&#8217;Albufera des Grau<\/em>, cor ecol\u00f2gic de l&#8217;illa. El <g id=\"gid_2\">Cam\u00ed de Cavalls<\/g> \u2014un sender hist\u00f2ric que circumval\u00b7la la costa en 20 etapes\u2014 permet explorar-la per trams. Aqu\u00ed et proposo <strong>sis rutes variades<\/strong> amb dist\u00e0ncies, temps i consells pr\u00e0ctics, m\u00e9s <strong>normes b\u00e0siques<\/strong> per conservar aquest entorn \u00fanic.  <\/p>\n      <div class=\"vm-badges\">\n        <span class=\"vm-badge\">Millor \u00e8poca: mar\u00e7\u2013juny \/ set.\u2013nov.<\/span>\n        <span class=\"vm-badge\">Evita hores centrals a l&#8217;estiu<\/span>\n        <span class=\"vm-badge\">Dificultat: baixa a mitjana<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    \n    <nav class=\"vm-card vm-toc\" aria-label=\"Contenido\">\n      <h2>Contingut<\/h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#ruta1\">Fav\u00e0ritx \u2192 Es Grau (Cam\u00ed de Cavalls)<\/a><\/li>\n        <li><a href=\"#ruta2\">Cala Pilar \u2192 Ets Alocs<\/a><\/li>\n        <li><a href=\"#ruta3\">Binigaus \u2192 Cova des Coloms<\/a><\/li>\n        <li><a href=\"#ruta4\">Barranc d&#8217;Algendar (Ferreries)<\/a><\/li>\n        <li><a href=\"#ruta5\">S&#8217;Albufera des Grau: Sa Gola &amp; Miradors<\/a><\/li>\n        <li><a href=\"#ruta6\">Macarella \u2194 Turqueta pel bosc litoral<\/a><\/li>\n        <li><a href=\"#consejos\">Consells, seguretat i equip<\/a><\/li>\n        <li><a href=\"#normas\">Normes de conservaci\u00f3<\/a><\/li>\n        <li><a href=\"#faq\">Preguntes freq\u00fcents<\/a><\/li>\n      <\/ul>\n    <\/nav>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"ruta1\" class=\"vm-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>1) Fav\u00e0ritx \u2192 Es Grau (Cam\u00ed de Cavalls, tram costaner)<\/h2>\n        <p>Cl\u00e0ssic del nord geol\u00f2gic. Arrenca al costat del far de <strong>Fav\u00e0ritx<\/strong>, en un paisatge fosc de pissarres i argiles, i progressa cap a cales d&#8217;arena clara i el poble mariner d&#8217;<strong>Es Grau<\/strong>. Sender costaner ben marcat, amb petites pujades i passos rocosos.  <\/p>\n        <div class=\"vm-info\">\n          <div><strong>Dist\u00e0ncia:<\/strong> 8\u20139 km (lineal)<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Temps:<\/strong> 3\u20133,5 h a ritme tranquil<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Desnivell:<\/strong> \u00b1150 m acumulats<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Terreny:<\/strong> roca i terra, trams irregulars<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Acc\u00e9s:<\/strong> Taxi\/transfer al far; bus a Es Grau (veure temporada)<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Ideal:<\/strong> Amants de costa i fotografia<\/div>\n        <\/div>\n        <p class=\"vm-note\">Amb <strong>tramuntana<\/strong> forta, l&#8217;onatge pot ser notable. Si busques calma, valora una ruta a la costa sud aquell dia. <\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Cam%C3%AD%20de%20cavalls.jpg?width=1400\" alt=\"Pal i senyal del Cam\u00ed de Cavalls davant del mar a Menorca\">\n        <figcaption>Cam\u00ed de Cavalls, sender hist\u00f2ric que recorre el litoral.<\/figcaption>\n      <\/figure>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"ruta2\" class=\"vm-grid\">\n      <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Cala_Pilar.jpg?width=1400\" alt=\"Cala Pilar amb arena vermellosa i dunes a la costa nord de Menorca\">\n        <figcaption>Cala Pilar, una de les joies del nord.<\/figcaption>\n      <\/figure>\n      <div>\n        <h2>2) Cala Pilar \u2192 Ets Alocs (litoral de Tramuntana)<\/h2>\n        <p>Ruta esc\u00e8nica entre <strong>dunes vermelloses<\/strong>, penya-segats i cales de c\u00f2dols. Es pot fer com a <em>lineal<\/em> (Pilar \u2192 Ets Alocs) o com a <em>anada i tornada<\/em> des de l&#8217;aparcament del Cam\u00ed del Pilar. Panor\u00e0miques espectaculars en dies clars.  <\/p>\n        <div class=\"vm-info\">\n          <div><strong>Dist\u00e0ncia:<\/strong> 8\u201312 km segons variant<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Temps:<\/strong> 3\u20134,5 h<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Desnivell:<\/strong> \u00b1250 m<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Terreny:<\/strong> arena, roca i sender amb passos<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Acc\u00e9s:<\/strong> P\u00e0rquing Cam\u00ed del Pilar<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Ideal:<\/strong> Fotografia i geologia costanera<\/div>\n        <\/div>\n        <p>A <strong>Ets Alocs<\/strong> trobar\u00e0s platja de c\u00f2dols i aigua molt clara; bon lloc per a un bany si el mar est\u00e0 en calma.<\/p>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"ruta3\" class=\"vm-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>3) Binigaus \u2192 Cova des Coloms (la \u201ccatedral\u201d de Menorca)<\/h2>\n        <p>Passeig perfecte per a fam\u00edlies. Des de la platja de <strong>Binigaus<\/strong> o el cam\u00ed interior, el sender s&#8217;endinsa en un barranc amb alzines i ullastres fins arribar a l&#8217;enorme <strong>Cova des Coloms<\/strong> (110 m de longitud i uns 24 m d&#8217;altura). \u00c9s imprescindible <strong>llanterna<\/strong> i cal\u00e7at tancat; respecta els ratpenats.  <\/p>\n        <div class=\"vm-info\">\n          <div><strong>Dist\u00e0ncia:<\/strong> 5\u20136 km anada i tornada<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Temps:<\/strong> 1,5\u20132,5 h<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Desnivell:<\/strong> suau<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Terreny:<\/strong> pista i sender de terra<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Acc\u00e9s:<\/strong> Sant Tom\u00e0s \/ Es Migjorn Gran<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Ideal:<\/strong> Fam\u00edlies i curiosos de l&#8217;espeleologia<\/div>\n        <\/div>\n        <p class=\"vm-note\">No deixis residus ni facis foc. La cova \u00e9s un <strong>BIC<\/strong> (B\u00e9 d&#8217;Inter\u00e8s Cultural) i un h\u00e0bitat sensible. <\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Cova%20des%20Coloms.jpg?width=1400\" alt=\"Entrada monumental de la Cova des Coloms al barranc de Binigaus, Menorca\">\n        <figcaption>Cova des Coloms, la \u201ccatedral\u201d natural de l&#8217;illa.<\/figcaption>\n      <\/figure>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"ruta4\" class=\"vm-grid\">\n      <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Barranc%20D%C2%B4Algendar.jpg?width=1400\" alt=\"Barranc d'Algendar amb parets calc\u00e0ries i vegetaci\u00f3 mediterr\u00e0nia a Menorca\">\n        <figcaption>El corredor verd del Barranc d&#8217;Algendar.<\/figcaption>\n      <\/figure>\n      <div>\n        <h2>4) Barranc d&#8217;Algendar (Ferreries): ombra, horts i ocells<\/h2>\n        <p>Un dels barrancs m\u00e9s llargs de Menorca. Ruta molt agradable en dies calorosos: hi ha <strong>ombra<\/strong> bona part del cam\u00ed, cants d&#8217;ocells i finques de cultiu tradicional. Ideal per observar flora mediterr\u00e0nia (llentiscle, aladern, margall\u00f3) i murs de pedra seca.  <\/p>\n        <div class=\"vm-info\">\n          <div><strong>Dist\u00e0ncia:<\/strong> 6\u20138 km anada i tornada<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Temps:<\/strong> 2\u20133 h<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Desnivell:<\/strong> baix<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Terreny:<\/strong> pista i sender<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Acc\u00e9s:<\/strong> Ferreries (diversos punts d&#8217;entrada)<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Ideal:<\/strong> Observaci\u00f3 d&#8217;ocells i bot\u00e0nica<\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"ruta5\" class=\"vm-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>5) S&#8217;Albufera des Grau: Sa Gola &amp; Miradors (itineraris senyalitzats)<\/h2>\n        <p>El <strong>parc natural<\/strong> ofereix recorreguts curts i ben indicats per con\u00e8ixer l&#8217;aiguamoll, les llacunes i el bosc litoral. Combinant la passarel\u00b7la de <em>Sa Gola<\/em> amb els miradors de <em>Cala Llimpa<\/em> i <em>es Grau<\/em> obtindr\u00e0s una visi\u00f3 completa de l&#8217;ecosistema. <\/p>\n        <div class=\"vm-info\">\n          <div><strong>Dist\u00e0ncia:<\/strong> 3\u20135 km segons bucle<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Temps:<\/strong> 1,5\u20132 h<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Desnivell:<\/strong> m\u00ednim<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Terreny:<\/strong> passarel\u00b7les i sender<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Acc\u00e9s:<\/strong> Centre de visitants \/ Es Grau<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Ideal:<\/strong> Observaci\u00f3 d&#8217;ocells (primavera\/tardor)<\/div>\n        <\/div>\n        <p class=\"vm-note\">Porta prism\u00e0tics. Entre les esp\u00e8cies habituals: agrons, corbs marins i cabussons. En \u00e8poca de nidificaci\u00f3, mant\u00e9n m\u00e0xima calma.  <\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/S%27Albufera%20des%20Grau%20(Parc%20Natural%20de)%20007.jpg?width=1400\" alt=\"Llacuna principal del Parc Natural de s'Albufera des Grau a Menorca\">\n        <figcaption>s&#8217;Albufera des Grau, cor ecol\u00f2gic de Menorca.<\/figcaption>\n      <\/figure>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"ruta6\" class=\"vm-grid\">\n      <figure class=\"vm-figure\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Ets%20Alocs%20en%20Menorca.jpg?width=1400\" alt=\"Costa nord de Menorca prop d'Ets Alocs amb aig\u00fces blaves\">\n        <figcaption>Trams del nord alternen cales de c\u00f2dols i miradors.<\/figcaption>\n      <\/figure>\n      <div>\n        <h2>6) Macarella \u2194 Turqueta pel bosc litoral (alternativa tranquil\u00b7la)<\/h2>\n        <p>Tram curt i ombr\u00edvol entre <strong>pinars i alzines<\/strong>. En temporada alta, aquestes cales s&#8217;omplen: per gaudir del cam\u00ed sense estr\u00e8s, et proposo fer-ho <em>molt d&#8217;hora<\/em> o al capvespre, evitant les platges en les hores punta. <\/p>\n        <div class=\"vm-info\">\n          <div><strong>Dist\u00e0ncia:<\/strong> 6\u20137 km anada i tornada<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Temps:<\/strong> 2\u20132,5 h<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Desnivell:<\/strong> baix<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Terreny:<\/strong> sender forestal i passarel\u00b7les<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Acc\u00e9s:<\/strong> Park&amp;Ride (bus llan\u00e7adora a l&#8217;estiu)<\/div>\n          <div><strong>Ideal:<\/strong> Passeig relaxat entre ombres<\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"consejos\" class=\"vm-card\">\n      <h2>Consells, seguretat i equip<\/h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Cal\u00e7at<\/strong> de sender o esportiva amb sola marcada. Evita xancletes. <\/li>\n        <li><strong>Aigua<\/strong>: m\u00ednim 1,5\u20132 L per persona en rutes costaneres. Afegeix sals en dies calorosos. <\/li>\n        <li><strong>Sol i vent<\/strong>: gorra, ulleres, crema <strong>biodegradable<\/strong>. Amb tramuntana, busca rutes del sud; amb vent del sud, el nord. <\/li>\n        <li><strong>Navegaci\u00f3<\/strong>: el Cam\u00ed de Cavalls est\u00e0 senyalitzat, per\u00f2 porta mapa\/GPX si et desvies. La cobertura m\u00f2bil pot fallar. <\/li>\n        <li><strong>Respecte<\/strong>: tanca portelles, no trepitgis cultius i saluda el pag\u00e8s; els camins travessen finques privades amb servitud de pas.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Transport<\/strong>: combina bus, taxi o transfer per a rutes lineals (p. ex., Fav\u00e0ritx \u2192 Es Grau).<\/li>\n      <\/ul>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n    <section id=\"normas\" class=\"vm-card\">\n      <h2>Normes de conservaci\u00f3<\/h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Roman als <strong>senders<\/strong> i respecta la <strong>duna<\/strong> i la <strong>posid\u00f2nia<\/strong>.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Prohibit<\/strong> fer foc, acampar o deixar residus. Porta sempre la teva bossa d&#8217;escombraries. <\/li>\n        <li><strong>Gossos<\/strong> amb corretja en zones sensibles i fora de platges amb restriccions.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>No recol\u00b7lectis<\/strong> flora, f\u00f2ssils ni pedres; s\u00f3n part de l&#8217;ecosistema.<\/li>\n        <li><strong>Drons<\/strong>: prohibits en \u00e0rees protegides excepte autoritzaci\u00f3 expressa.<\/li>\n      <\/ul>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n    <div class=\"vm-cta-final\">\n      <div class=\"vm-btns\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n        <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--whatsapp\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/34649902301?text=Hola%20Dani%2C%20quiero%20reservar%20una%20ruta%20de%20senderismo%20en%20Menorca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Reservar per WhatsApp<\/a>\n        <a class=\"vm-btn vm-btn--primary\" href=\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/ca\/excursiones\/\">Veure excursions<\/a>\n      <\/div>\n      <p style=\"opacity:.8\">Guia oficial a Menorca \u00b7 Daniel Vaquera \u00b7 APITMe<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    \n\n  <\/div>\n\n  \n  <script data-jetpack-boost=\"ignore\" type=\"application\/ld+json\">\n  {\n    \"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"BlogPosting\",\n    \"headline\": \"Rutas de senderismo en Menorca: 6 itinerarios para conectar con la naturaleza\",\n    \"image\": [\n      \"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Faro%20de%20Fav%C3%A0ritx.jpg?width=1600\",\n      \"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Cala_Pilar.jpg?width=1400\",\n      \"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Cova%20des%20Coloms.jpg?width=1400\",\n      \"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/Barranc%20D%C2%B4Algendar.jpg?width=1400\",\n      \"https:\/\/commons.wikimedia.org\/wiki\/Special:FilePath\/S%27Albufera%20des%20Grau%20(Parc%20Natural%20de)%20007.jpg?width=1400\"\n    ],\n    \"datePublished\": \"2025-09-16\",\n    \"dateModified\": \"2025-09-16\",\n    \"author\": {\"@type\":\"Person\", \"name\":\"Daniel Vaquera\"},\n    \"publisher\": {\"@type\":\"Organization\", \"name\":\"Voyager Menorca\"},\n    \"mainEntityOfPage\": {\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/voyagermenorca.com\/\"}\n  }\n  <\/script>\n\n  <section class=\"vm-card vm-faq\" id=\"faq\">\n    <h2>Preguntes freq\u00fcents<\/h2>\n    <h3>Puc fer aquestes rutes amb nens?<\/h3>\n    <p>S\u00ed: Binigaus\u2013Cova des Coloms i els itineraris de s&#8217;Albufera s\u00f3n ideals. Ajusta els temps i porta aigua i snacks. <\/p>\n    <h3>Cal guia?<\/h3>\n    <p>No \u00e9s obligatori, per\u00f2 <strong>un guia local<\/strong> aporta seguretat, dreceres, interpretaci\u00f3 ambiental i log\u00edstica (transfers, horaris, alternatives pel vent).<\/p>\n    <h3>Puc banyar-me en totes les rutes?<\/h3>\n    <p>En les costaneres s\u00ed (Fav\u00e0ritx\u2013Es Grau, Pilar\u2013Ets Alocs, Macarella\u2013Turqueta). En barrancs i el parc natural, respecta zones de fauna i senyalitzaci\u00f3. <\/p>\n  <\/section>\n<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Des dels imponents penya-segats del nord fins als senders que vorejgen la costa sud, cada ruta ofereix una experi\u00e8ncia \u00fanica. Est\u00e0s preparat per explorar? <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[],"ta